SUMMARY:🧪 Lab | Build A Fabric Real-Time Intelligence Solution in a Day
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:In this hands-on lab\, build event-driven pipelines and visuali
 ze live insights through interactive dashboards using Fabric Eventstream\,
  Eventhouse\, OneLake\, Lakehouse\, KQL\, notebooks\, and Data Activator.\
 n\nTopics:\n- Create a Fabric workspace and Eventhouse for Real-Time Intel
 ligence\n- Process streaming data with Eventstream and notebooks\n- Integr
 ate Eventhouse with Lakehouse\n- Build a live real-time dashboard with aut
 omated actions\n\nAudience: Data engineers\, architects\, and solution dev
 elopers with basic familiarity with Azure\, data pipelines\, real-time das
 hboards\, and Python.\n\nRegistration is required and subject to approval.
 \n\nThis series calendar is for discovery\, not registration. Entries are 
 marked Free. Register separately for the sessions you want to attend.\n\nR
 egistration closes Sunday\, December 13\, 2026 at 1:00 PM ET.\n\nRegister:
  https://ms-workshops.cloudevents.ai/ms-innovation-workshops/events/94bfee
 b4-605f-47e1-abb1-2fcb2b538501
